            82
          ],
          "chars": 235,
          "text_preview": "Our Productivity and Business Processes segment consists of products and services in our portfolio of productivity, communication, and information services, spanning a variety of d"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000093-7018adaa",
            "block-001187-7018adaa"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            5,
            82
          ],
          "chars": 458,
          "text_preview": "Microsoft 365 Commercial products and cloud services, including Microsoft 365 Commercial cloud, comprising Microsoft 365 Commercial, Enterprise Mobility + Security, the cloud porti"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000095-61bd513b",
            "block-001189-61bd513b"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            5,
            82
          ],
          "chars": 157,
          "text_preview": "Microsoft 365 Consumer products and cloud services, including Microsoft 365 Consumer subscriptions, Office licensed on-premises, and other consumer services."
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000097-13124fb7",
            "block-001191-13124fb7"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            5,
            82
          ],
          "chars": 102,
          "text_preview": "LinkedIn, including Talent Solutions, Marketing Solutions, Premium Subscriptions, and Sales Solutions."
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000099-da3d48eb",
            "block-001193-da3d48eb"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            5,
            82
          ],
          "chars": 210,
          "text_preview": "Dynamics products and cloud services, including Dynamics 365, comprising a set of intelligent, cloud-based applications across ERP, CRM, Power Apps, and Power Automate; and on-prem"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000118-5e917062",
            "block-001198-5e917062"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            6,
            83
          ],
          "chars": 185,
          "text_preview": "Our Intelligent Cloud segment consists of our public, private, and hybrid server products and cloud services that power modern business and developers. This segment primarily compr"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000120-c34f7245",
            "block-001200-c34f7245"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            6,
            83
          ],
          "chars": 403,
          "text_preview": "Server products and cloud services, including Azure and other cloud services, comprising cloud and AI consumption-based services, GitHub cloud services, Nuance Healthcare cloud ser"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000122-c07a987e",
            "block-001202-c07a987e"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            6,
            83
          ],
          "chars": 173,
          "text_preview": "Enterprise and partner services, including Enterprise Support Services, Industry Solutions, Nuance professional services, Microsoft Partner Network, and Learning Experience."
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000144-6e0ae0c4",
            "block-001204-6e0ae0c4"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            8,
            83
          ],
          "chars": 175,
          "text_preview": "Our More Personal Computing segment consists of products and services that put customers at the center of the experience with our technology. This segment primarily comprises:"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000146-c641cfcd",
            "block-001206-c641cfcd"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            8,
            83
          ],
          "chars": 168,
          "text_preview": "Windows and Devices, including Windows OEM licensing (Windows Pro and non-Pro licenses sold through the OEM channel) and Devices, comprising Surface and PC accessories."
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000148-2f215a60",
            "block-001208-2f215a60"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            8,
            83
          ],
          "chars": 241,
          "text_preview": "Gaming, including Xbox hardware and Xbox content and services, comprising first- and third-party content (including games and in-game content), Xbox Game Pass and other subscriptio"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000150-9577a591",
            "block-001210-9577a591"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            8,
            83
          ],
          "chars": 117,
          "text_preview": "Search and news advertising, comprising Bing and Copilot, Microsoft News, Microsoft Edge, and third-party affiliates."
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000674-86989d2f",
            "block-001096-86989d2f"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            42,
            76
          ],
          "chars": 894,
          "text_preview": "We remain under audit by the IRS for tax years 2014 to 2017. With respect to the audit for tax years 2004 to 2013, on September 26, 2023, we received Notices of Proposed Adjustment"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000675-987b0de3",
            "block-001097-987b0de3"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            42,
            76
          ],
          "chars": 329,
          "text_preview": "We are subject to income tax in many jurisdictions outside the U.S., some of which are currently under audit by local tax authorities. The resolution of these audits is not expecte"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000726-c6744a38",
            "block-000840-c6744a38"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            45,
            56
          ],
          "chars": 934,
          "text_preview": "Our contracts with customers often include promises to transfer multiple products and services to a customer. Determining whether products and services are considered distinct perf"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000731-e3a9fad5",
            "block-000845-e3a9fad5"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            46,
            57
          ],
          "chars": 500,
          "text_preview": "In instances where SSP is not directly observable, such as when we do not sell the product or service separately, we determine the SSP using information that may include market con"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000732-a11b29f9",
            "block-000846-a11b29f9"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            46,
            57
          ],
          "chars": 208,
          "text_preview": "Due to the various benefits from and the nature of our SA program, judgment is required to assess the pattern of delivery, including the exercise pattern of certain benefits across"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-000733-8cbf3598",
            "block-000847-8cbf3598"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            46,
            57
          ],
          "chars": 526,
          "text_preview": "Our products are generally sold with a right of return, we may provide other credits or incentives, and in certain instances we estimate customer usage of our products and services"
        },
        {
          "block_ids": [
            "block-001031-b3eedf85",
            "block-001101-b3eedf85",
            "block-001182-b3eedf85"
          ],
          "reported_pages": [
            71,
            76,
            82
          ],
          "chars": 175,
          "text_preview": "We have recast certain prior period amounts to conform to the way we internally manage and monitor our business. Refer to Note 1 – Accounting Policies for further information."
        }
